@startuml
skinparam participantPadding 15
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "Order Service" as Producer
participant "Kafka" as K <<Queue>>
participant "Payment Service" as Consumer

Producer ->> K : publish(OrderCreatedEvent)
note right K
  Topic: `orders`
  Partition: 1
  Key: order_id=1042
end note

K ->> Consumer : consume(OrderCreatedEvent)
note left K
  Consumer Group: `payment-workers`
  Offset: 15892
end note

Consumer --> Producer : (опц. async ack via callback)
@enduml